msgstr "Poort"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:131
msgid "TLS for IMAP"
msgstr "TLS voor IMAP"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:132
msgid ""
"TLS (also known as SSL) is usually only needed when using port 993. For "
"other ports EmailEngine falls back to using STARTTLS based encryption."
msgstr ""
"TLS (ook wel SSL genoemd) is meestal alleen nodig bij het gebruik van poort "
"993. Voor andere poorten schakelt EmailEngine over op STARTTLS-versleuteling."

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:139
#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:246
msgid "Use TLS"
msgstr "Gebruik TLS"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:148
msgid "SMTP"
msgstr "SMTP"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:238
msgid "TLS for SMTP"
msgstr "TLS voor SMTP"

#: views/accounts/register/imap-server.hbs:239
msgid ""
"TLS (also known as SSL) is usually only needed when using port 465. For "
"other ports EmailEngine falls back to using STARTTLS based encryption."
msgstr ""
"TLS (ook wel SSL genoemd) is meestal alleen nodig bij het gebruik van poort "
"465. Voor andere poorten schakelt EmailEngine over op STARTTLS-versleuteling."

